<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_a87408716214d53d13c9ba8e0a71ed128e432427b9fd19f3db741ec2ad3ae9e5_n0002/e_0015> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasNormalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_a87408716214d53d13c9ba8e0a71ed128e432427b9fd19f3db741ec2ad3ae9e5_n0002/e_0015/normalization> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Patients%20without%20an%20ICD> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/Population> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_a87408716214d53d13c9ba8e0a71ed128e432427b9fd19f3db741ec2ad3ae9e5_n0002/tu_0013> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "This depends on your heart problem. Talk to your doctor about driving limitations and other activities." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_a87408716214d53d13c9ba8e0a71ed128e432427b9fd19f3db741ec2ad3ae9e5_n0002/tu_0014/locator> <http://digistrucmed.org/headerPath> "Are there things I cannot do?" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_a87408716214d53d13c9ba8e0a71ed128e432427b9fd19f3db741ec2ad3ae9e5_n0002/tu_0013> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/TextUnit> .
